WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:02.085
Module 13.

00:00:02.085 --> 00:00:03.430
The Income Engine.

00:00:03.430 --> 00:00:05.315
Part of Stage 5, Operator.

00:00:06.615 --> 00:00:09.348
By the end of this module, you'll be able

00:00:09.348 --> 00:00:13.317
to design an income portfolio, measure expected income after

00:00:13.317 --> 00:00:16.870
expected losses, and set a payout you can sustain.

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:18.225
That's the standard.

00:00:18.225 --> 00:00:20.195
Every lesson moves you toward it.

00:00:21.495 --> 00:00:23.684
There are 5 lessons, starting with

00:00:23.684 --> 00:00:26.235
Income sources ranked by durability.

00:00:26.235 --> 00:00:28.214
Each one ends with a checklist to

00:00:28.214 --> 00:00:30.485
do for real, and a three-question quiz.

00:00:31.785 --> 00:00:33.441
If the topic is new to

00:00:33.441 --> 00:00:36.405
you, start with Mastery Starter 13.0.

00:00:36.405 --> 00:00:38.300
It takes about ten minutes.

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:40.454
Then take the lessons in order, because

00:00:40.454 --> 00:00:42.585
each one builds on the one before.

00:00:42.585 --> 00:00:44.392
And do the checklists for real,

00:00:44.392 --> 00:00:46.425
with small test amounts, every time.

00:00:47.725 --> 00:00:50.380
Let's begin, with lesson 13.0.
